    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku lunaku olweikumi mu mwezi ogwokutaanu, mu mwaka ogwomusanvu nga tuli mu bunhage, ghaabaagho abandi ku bakulembeze ab'omu Isiraeli abaidha ni batyama agho mu maiso gange nga benda okwebuuza ku Musengwa Katonda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Musengwa Katonda yankoba ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Iwe omuntu, yogera n'abakulembeze ab'omu Isiraeli abo obakobe oti nze Musengwa Katonda ndi kubakoba nti: Mwidhie kuneebuuzaaku? Aye ni, nze Musengwa Katonda ndayira nti nga bwendi omulamu tiidha kubaganha naire kuneebuuzaaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Iwe omuntu, oli mwetegefu okubasalira omusango? Bwenebwene oli mwetegefu? Kale ni baidhukize ebyenhinhalwa badhaadha baibwe bye baakola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.6.2+GEN.6.3+GEN.6.4+GEN.6.5+GEN.6.6+GEN.6.7+GEN.6.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mainh 6:2-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Era obakobe oti nze Musengwa Katonda ndi kubakoba nti: Olunaku lwe neeroboza eighanga Isiraeli, abaana ba Yakobo abo, nabeeyandhulira nga bali mu nsi Misiri, naabamanhisa nti ninze Musengwa Katonda waibwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era ku olwo nabasuubiza okubatoola mu nsi Misiri, mbatwale mu nsi ye nabategekera engimu era erimu ebirungi kamaala, esinga edhindi dhoonadhoona ekitiibwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naabakoba nti basuule ere ebyenhinhalwa ebibasikiriza, era balobe kweyonoona nga basinza ebitali nze Katonda eby'omu Misiri, kuba ninze Musengwa Katonda waibwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye bandheemera, baaloba kuwulirisa bye nabakoba. Baaloba kusuula ere ebyenhinhalwa ebyabasikirizanga, waire okuva ku bisinzibwa ebitali nze Katonda eby'omu Misiri. Agho naayenda okubamaliraku ekiruyi kyange, mboolekeze obusungu bwange nga bali eyo mu nsi Misiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye ekyo tyakikola ku lw'eriina lyange, lirobe kunhoomebwa mu maghanga ge baalimu, kuba ab'omu maghanga ago baaligho nga nsuubiza Abaisiraeli abo nti ndi kuja kubatoola mu nsi Misiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kale naabatoola mu nsi Misiri naabatwala mu irungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.18.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 18:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naabagha ebiragiro byange, naabeegeresa n'amateeka gange kuba ebyo nga n'ebireetera omuntu okuba omulamu ng'abituukiriiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.31.13+EXO.31.14+EXO.31.15+EXO.31.16+EXO.31.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuv 31:13-17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Era naabateeragho n'olunaku lwa Sabbato ng'akamanhiso ghagati ghange ni beene, okubaidhukizanga nti nze Musengwa Katonda mwene, ninze mbatukuza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye abantu ab'eighanga Isiraeli bandheemera nga bali eyo mu irungu, baaloba kujiira ku mateeka gange era baava ku biragiro byange, ebireetera omuntu okuba omulamu ng'abituukiriiza. Era baayonoona olunaku lwange olwa Sabbato. Agho naayenda mbamalireku ekiruyi kyange nga bali eyo mu irungu, mbazikirize mbamaliriregho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye ekyo tyakikola ku lw'eriina lyange, lirobe kunhoomebwa mu maghanga ge baalimu, kuba ab'omu maghanga ago baabona nga ndi kubatoola mu nsi Misiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.14.26+NUM.14.27+NUM.14.28+NUM.14.29+NUM.14.30+NUM.14.31+NUM.14.32+NUM.14.33+NUM.14.34+NUM.14.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 14:26-35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kale, nze neerayirira mwene nga bali eyo mu irungu, nti tiribatuusa mu nsi ye nabagha, ensi engimu era erimu ebirungi kamaala, esinga edhindi dhoonadhoona ekitiibwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neerayirira ntyo lwa kuba baava ku biragiro byange era baaloba kujiira ku mateeka gange. Baayonoona n'olunaku lwange olwa Sabbato, era baasinzanga ebitali nze Katonda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aye nabasaasira, naaloba kubazikiriza kubamaliriragho nga bali eyo mu irungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho naalabula abaana baibwe nga bali eyo mu irungu, nti mutajiira ku mateeka badhaadha baimwe ge baataagho, era mutagondera biragiro byaibwe, waire okweyonoona nga musinza ebyo bye basinza ebitali nze Katonda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nze Musengwa Katonda ninze Katonda waimwe, mujiirenga ku mateeka gange era mukolenga bye ndagira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukuzenga olunaku lwa Sabbato nga lutukuvu, lubenga akamanhiso ak'endagaano nze ye nakola n'imwe, era lubaidhukizenga nga nze Musengwa Katonda mwene, ninze Katonda waimwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aye abaana boona bandheemera, baaloba kujiira ku mateeka gange era baava ku biragiro byange, ebireetera omuntu okuba omulamu ng'abituukiriiza. Baayonoona n'olunaku lwange olwa Sabbato. Agho naayenda okubamaliraku ekiruyi kyange, mboolekeze obusungu bwange nga bali eyo mu nsi Misiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye neefuga, ekyo naaloba kukikola ku lw'eriina lyange, olwo lirobe kunhoomebwa mu maghanga ge baalimu, kuba ab'omu maghanga ago baabona nga ndi kubatoola mu nsi Misiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale, nze n'okwiramu kabiri okwerayirira mwene nga bali eyo mu irungu, nti ndidha kubasansaaniza eyo mu maghanga, mbaidhuze eyo mu nsi enhingi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neerayirira ntyo lwa kuba baava ku biragiro byange era baaloba kujiira ku mateeka gange. Baayonoona n'olunaku lwange olwa Sabbato, era baasinzanga ebitali nze Katonda ebya badhaadha baibwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Agho naabaleka bajiire ku mateeka ni ku biragiro, ebitaleetera muntu abijiiraku kuba mulamu naire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naabaleka beeyonoona nga bagheereza eri emisambwa ebigheebwayo, era nga baghaayo y'emisambwa egyo abaana baibwe ababeri bookebwe mu muliro ng'emisengo. Ekyo nakikola nga nhenda mbabonereze era bamanhe nga ninze Musengwa Katonda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Agho ni, iwe omuntu, yogera n'ab'eighanga Isiraeli, obakobe oti nze Musengwa Katonda ndi kubakoba ati: Eyo n'eyindi ku ngeri badhaadha baimwe dhe baanhoomangamu nze Musengwa Katonda, era ni balobanga okuba abeesigwa ye ndi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe nabatuusa mu nsi nze mwene ye neerayirira okubagha, ng'olwo buli ghe baabonanga akasozi akagulumivu oba omuti ogw'amakaba amangi amazibirivu, ng'agho bagheeragho emisengo gyaibwe. Ebigheebwayo byaibwe bye baagheeranga mu bifo ebyo, n'obuwoowo bwe baaniokezangayo, era n'ebigheebwayo eby'okunhwa bye baafukangayo, byansungughazanga busungughaze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naababuuza nti, ‘Kifo ki ekigulumivu eyo ye mujanga okusinziza?’ N'okuva ku olwo kyayetebwanga ‘Ekifo ekigulumivu eky'okusinzizaamu’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20:29:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ekifo ekigulumivu:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ago nga n'amasabo Abayudaaya ge bataikirizibwanga kusinzizaamu. Ekibono eky'Oluheburayi ekitegeeza “Ekifo ekigulumivu” kiwulikika ng'oti n'eky'Oluheburayi ekitegeeza kiti “eyo ye mujanga.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ni ye buli eno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho ni, kobera abantu ab'eighanga Isiraeli oti nze Musengwa Katonda ndi kubabuuza ati: Mwena muli kwenda kweyonoona ng'oti ni badhaadha baimwe, nga musinza ebitali nze Katonda ebyenhinhalwa bye baasinzanga? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni ye buli eno mukeeyonoona nga musinza ebitali nze Katonda, mwaghaayo ebigheebwayo byaimwe, era mwaghaayo n'abaana baimwe bookebwe mu muliro ng'emisengo. Memale ng'obwo era imwe abantu ab'eighanga Isiraeli mwidha mbu kuneebuuzaaku? Bwenebwene nze Musengwa Katonda ndayira nti nga bwendi omulamu, tija kubaganha kuneebuuzaaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni bwekiba ekyo kye mulowooza mbu mwenda mube ng'abamaghanga agandi n'abantu ab'omu nsi edhindi, musinze emiti n'amabaale, tikija kubaagho naire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nze Musengwa Katonda ndayira nti nga bwendi omulamu, mu busungu obubitirivu ndikozesa obuyinza bwange obungi n'amaani gange agataloodheka, naabafuga nga ninze kyabazinga waimwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu busungu obubitirivu ndikozesa obuyinza bwange obungi n'amaani gange agataloodheka, naabatoolayo eyo mu maghanga, naabasolozaayo eyo mu nsi ye mwasansaanira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndibatwala mu irungu ery'abamaghanga agandi, naabasalirira eyo omusango nga tubonagana maiso ku maiso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga bwe nasalira badhaadha baimwe omusango mu irungu ery'ensi Misiri, mwena ntyo bwenja okubasalira.” Musengwa Katonda atyo bw'akoba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ndibafuga na mwigo naabaleetera okugondera endagaano yange. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndibasunsulamu abo abadheemu, n'abo abakola ebibi ni bansungughaza. Ndibatoola mu nsi dhe baasengamu, aye tiribaganha kwirayo mu Isiraeli. Olwo mulimanha nga ninze Musengwa Katonda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda era akoba ati: “Mperaano imwe Abaisiraeli, oba nga timwenda kumpulira, buli muntu aje agheereze ebisinzibwa bye ebitali nze Katonda. Aye mbalabula obutairayo kwonoona liina lyange eitukuvu, eno nga mumpa ebigheebwayo ate ere nga bwemusinza ebitali nze Katonda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mu kifo eky'okusinza ebyo, mwenamwena mulisinzanga nze Musengwa Katonda waimwe, ku lusozi lwange olutukuvu, olusozi oluleeyi olw'omu nsi Isiraeli. Eyo ye ndibasangaalira, era naasiima ebirabo byaimwe ebisinga kuba birungi, ghalala n'ebigheebwayo byaimwe ebitukuvu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EPH.5.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Efe 5:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PHP.4.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Fil 4:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwendimala okubatoolayo eyo mu maghanga, ni mbasolozaayo eyo mu nsi ye mwasansaanira, ndisiima emisengo gyaimwe egyokebwa, era mulirangirira eri amaghanga nga bwendi omutukuvu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe ndibatuusa mu nsi Isiraeli, ensi ye nalayira okugha badhaadha baimwe, olwo mulimanha nga ninze Musengwa Katonda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.6.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezek 6:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.36.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "36:31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nga muli eyo muliidhukira emize gyaimwe n'ebikolwa byaimwe byonabyona bye mweyonoona nabyo. Olwo mwenenia era mwawulira n'enaku olw'ebibi byaimwe byonabyona bye mwakola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imwe abantu b'eighanga Isiraeli, ku lw'eriina lyange bwe ndibabisa obukalamu mu kifo eky'okubabisa obubi nga njiira ku bikolwa byaimwe ebikyamu ni ku mpisa dhaimwe embi, olwo mulimanha nga ninze Musengwa Katonda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho kabiri Musengwa Katonda yankoba ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Iwe omuntu, amaiso go galingirize ku luuyi olw'omukono omusaadha olw'e buvandhuba. Olange ng'ovumirira ekiketezo ekyo ekikalukalu, era ng'ovumirira n'ekibira ekiri mu kiketezo ekyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koba ekibira ekyo ekiri mu kiketezo ekikalukalu ekyo, kiwulirise nze Musengwa Katonda bye ndikukoba nti: Bona eno, ndikukunaaniaku omuliro gwayokya buli muti gwonagwona ogukulimu, ka gube omubisi oba omukalu. Omuliro gulibbeibbera era tighalibaagho muntu asobola kuguzikiza. Gulyokerera buli muntu, okuva ku luuyi olw'omukono omusaadha olw'e buvandhuba okutuuka ku luuyi olw'omugooda olw'e buvandhuba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 20:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu boonaboona balibona nga nze Musengwa Katonda mwene, ninze nkunaaniza omuliro ogwo, era tighalibaagho asobola kuguzikiza.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.20.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.20.48"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
